WEBVTT

00:01:30.600 --> 00:01:32.360
Morning! Morning!

00:01:35.440 --> 00:01:36.860
Sonya-chan!

00:01:36.860 --> 00:01:38.240
Look, look!

00:01:38.240 --> 00:01:40.960
It's snow! Snow!

00:01:40.960 --> 00:01:44.380
Yahoo!

00:01:47.310 --> 00:01:49.580
Huh? Lantern light show...

00:01:50.650 --> 00:01:54.760
You should do that someplace where there's more snow.

00:02:05.940 --> 00:02:07.760
We're finally here...

00:02:08.720 --> 00:02:10.310
What's with that?

00:02:10.310 --> 00:02:13.150
I wanted to make a snowman!

00:02:15.660 --> 00:02:16.660
Where's the head?

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:18.470
Now that you mention it...

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:20.270
Notice earlier!

00:02:20.270 --> 00:02:21.110
Dammit!

00:02:21.730 --> 00:02:23.510
Then I'll just have to make do instead!

00:02:25.120 --> 00:02:26.990
Are you going to stay there all day?

00:02:27.990 --> 00:02:29.530
In that case...

00:02:29.660 --> 00:02:30.720
There!

00:02:32.830 --> 00:02:35.000
Now it's a real snowma—

00:02:36.940 --> 00:02:38.350
Oh, icicles!

00:02:38.350 --> 00:02:40.170
Hey Sonya-chan, grab one for me!

00:02:40.170 --> 00:02:41.200
No way.

00:02:42.610 --> 00:02:44.970
Fine, I'll get it myself.

00:02:50.350 --> 00:02:51.600
You stupid...

00:02:51.600 --> 00:02:53.630
It wasn't on purpose...

00:02:57.200 --> 00:02:57.850
Now's my chance!

00:02:57.850 --> 00:02:58.920
Stop!

00:03:01.070 --> 00:03:01.900
Dammit!

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:03.300
Where did she go?

00:03:11.340 --> 00:03:13.960
After schooool. After school.

00:03:16.940 --> 00:03:18.820
There's quite a lot of snow now.

00:03:18.820 --> 00:03:21.510
Look Sonya-chan, it's snow!

00:03:21.510 --> 00:03:23.650
Want to eat some?

00:03:23.650 --> 00:03:25.660
What am I, a kid?

00:03:25.660 --> 00:03:29.080
What if I made it for adults?

00:03:29.080 --> 00:03:30.060
Tuna sushi!

00:03:31.360 --> 00:03:33.470
That's not the issue here.

00:03:33.470 --> 00:03:35.060
I know, silly!

00:03:35.060 --> 00:03:38.310
If you eat snow, it's bad for your stomach.

00:03:38.310 --> 00:03:40.350
Then don't suggest it in the first place.

00:03:40.660 --> 00:03:42.860
But this is my masterpiece!

00:03:42.860 --> 00:03:45.170
Ultra-realistic looking shaved ice!

00:03:45.170 --> 00:03:46.810
Well, that's what it is...

00:03:48.020 --> 00:03:49.030
Oh, right...

00:03:49.740 --> 00:03:50.830
It is...

00:03:54.150 --> 00:03:55.910
She's eating it?!

00:03:57.140 --> 00:04:00.500
Whatever. I'm going home.

00:04:05.860 --> 00:04:08.810
Are you running away without participating in this mandatory event?

00:04:09.930 --> 00:04:11.950
Woah! Timeout!

00:04:12.760 --> 00:04:14.560
Throw snowballs!

00:04:14.560 --> 00:04:17.560
Knives are unfair in a snowball fight!

00:04:17.560 --> 00:04:19.690
Says the person who started with a sneak attack.

00:04:19.690 --> 00:04:22.150
You're not allowed to use hidden rocks either!

00:04:22.610 --> 00:04:23.980
Really?

00:04:24.780 --> 00:04:25.700
Not allowed, huh...

00:04:27.050 --> 00:04:28.010
Then...

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:30.410
Let's go.

00:04:30.410 --> 00:04:33.460
That's even worse than rocks!

00:04:33.460 --> 00:04:34.190
Bah.

00:04:35.720 --> 00:04:36.970
Then...

00:04:40.710 --> 00:04:44.530
In the palms of Sonya-chan's hands

00:04:44.530 --> 00:04:45.950
something oh so bad

00:04:46.300 --> 00:04:48.110
is being brought forth.

00:04:51.410 --> 00:04:54.150
Dammit, where's she hiding?

00:04:54.970 --> 00:04:57.770
Getting hit with that isn't going to be pretty...

00:04:57.770 --> 00:05:00.870
I'll make a bird out of snow to distract her with.

00:05:01.140 --> 00:05:03.350
A duck for me to duck out...

00:05:04.570 --> 00:05:05.560
There!

00:05:08.070 --> 00:05:09.600
I win.

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:11.820
Not yet!

00:05:15.770 --> 00:05:17.160
What are you doing?

00:05:18.800 --> 00:05:21.500
I almost passed away into the next world!

00:05:21.500 --> 00:05:24.170
How about I see you off then.

00:05:24.170 --> 00:05:26.000
Like I'll let you!

00:05:26.520 --> 00:05:27.870
Stuuupid!

00:05:27.870 --> 00:05:29.070
Serves you right!

00:05:36.860 --> 00:05:40.910
We should have just made snowmen from the start...

00:05:40.910 --> 00:05:42.870
Why me too?

00:05:45.360 --> 00:05:47.010
That's a lot.

00:05:47.010 --> 00:05:48.310
We made too many.

00:05:50.100 --> 00:05:51.320
What's wrong?

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:53.450
My purse... it's gone!

00:05:55.050 --> 00:05:57.990
It's got to be in one of the snowmen!

00:05:57.990 --> 00:06:00.310
Stop! After all that effort...

00:06:00.310 --> 00:06:01.080
Move!

00:06:01.080 --> 00:06:02.330
I'm sure it's inside!

00:06:08.720 --> 00:06:11.160
Someone dropped this purse.

00:06:12.710 --> 00:06:15.160
Good girl!

00:06:15.650 --> 00:06:18.350
The next day.

00:06:18.350 --> 00:06:19.860
Good morning!

00:06:19.860 --> 00:06:21.200
I caught a cold!

00:06:21.200 --> 00:06:23.760
You're pretty lively for a sick person.

00:06:24.510 --> 00:06:25.940
Because...

00:06:26.410 --> 00:06:29.690
Catching a cold means I'm not an idiot!

00:06:30.820 --> 00:06:31.900
Alpaca!

00:06:34.410 --> 00:06:36.330
That was too lively...

00:06:37.000 --> 00:06:38.370
What an idiot.

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:41.100
Calm down or you're not going to get better.

00:06:43.310 --> 00:06:45.370
Even if I don't...

00:06:45.370 --> 00:06:48.380
My cold will go away if I pass it on!

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:51.570
Too bad.

00:06:52.080 --> 00:06:53.890
You touched me!

00:06:53.890 --> 00:06:56.330
That was my trap to infect you!

00:06:56.330 --> 00:06:57.260
What?

00:07:00.610 --> 00:07:01.900
Sinus spray?

00:07:01.900 --> 00:07:05.390
Why didn't you lend it to me if you had one?

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:07.770
I'm borrowing this.

00:07:07.770 --> 00:07:09.230
Wait, that's—

00:07:11.010 --> 00:07:12.650
Pepper spray...

00:07:13.360 --> 00:07:16.410
Hey, something's over there.

00:07:16.940 --> 00:07:19.640
Let's get sick together!

00:07:19.640 --> 00:07:20.940
It'll be fun!

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:23.800
We get to stay home from school!

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:25.350
Yet you came...

00:07:25.350 --> 00:07:27.910
Everyone's kind to you!

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:30.500
There's lots of benefits!

00:07:30.500 --> 00:07:32.460
Break from school,

00:07:32.460 --> 00:07:33.800
tamagozake,

00:07:33.800 --> 00:07:35.400
rice porridge.

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:37.760
And above all,

00:07:38.130 --> 00:07:41.730
when you have a cold, you can eat this!

00:07:41.730 --> 00:07:44.140
You can just eat that whenever you want.

00:07:44.140 --> 00:07:46.460
You don't see me much lately.

00:07:46.460 --> 00:07:47.600
I'm a bagworm.

00:07:47.600 --> 00:07:48.940
Ta da!

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:51.570
I brought a water pillow!

00:07:54.220 --> 00:07:56.110
Feels so nice...

00:07:57.690 --> 00:07:59.380
Hey, what about class?

00:08:00.000 --> 00:08:02.660
Class when I'm sick?

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:03.810
What's wrong with you?

00:08:03.810 --> 00:08:04.810
Go home!!

00:08:08.080 --> 00:08:10.570
This water pillow's pretty tough!

00:08:10.850 --> 00:08:13.630
Let's try it out to see!

00:08:13.630 --> 00:08:16.470
Don't hold back just because I'm sick.

00:08:16.470 --> 00:08:17.130
Really?

00:08:21.410 --> 00:08:23.140
It got worse...

00:08:23.620 --> 00:08:25.390
You should have just gone home early.

00:08:25.920 --> 00:08:29.340
Wait, are you worried about me?

00:08:29.340 --> 00:08:32.820
You're being so annoying I was just wondering if you wouldn't go home already.

00:08:32.820 --> 00:08:34.500
I'm fine!

00:08:34.500 --> 00:08:37.730
I'll be fine by tomorrow!

00:08:39.460 --> 00:08:44.020
I'm looking forward to seeing your turn being sick tomorrow!

00:08:45.170 --> 00:08:48.540
The next day. The next day.

00:08:48.540 --> 00:08:50.000
I'm better!

00:08:50.660 --> 00:08:51.730
Morning!

00:08:53.380 --> 00:08:57.000
We were together all day, but you're fine?

00:08:58.030 --> 00:09:00.360
A-Are you an idiot?

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:01.680
What was that?!

00:09:02.760 --> 00:09:05.060
That's strange...

00:09:05.060 --> 00:09:08.190
There's no way I'd catch your cold.

00:09:10.720 --> 00:09:13.330
You just coughed, didn't you?

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:15.410
You caught it!

00:09:15.410 --> 00:09:17.190
That was just a coincidence.

00:09:17.190 --> 00:09:20.050
No way! You have a fever, don't you?

00:09:20.050 --> 00:09:21.870
Don't hide it now!

00:09:21.870 --> 00:09:23.620
You can eat canned peaches now!

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.430
I said I'm not sick!

00:09:25.430 --> 00:09:27.260
Oh, come on.

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:29.060
I'll bet you're at 39°C already.

00:09:29.060 --> 00:09:31.020
No, 40°C!

00:09:31.020 --> 00:09:32.260
Based on what?

00:09:32.260 --> 00:09:36.040
Fine, then let's find out.

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:38.630
Alright, show me your forehead!

00:09:47.670 --> 00:09:49.890
I caught your cold...

00:09:49.890 --> 00:09:52.070
You were so noisy yours relapsed.

00:09:52.060 --> 00:09:54.550
I'm going home early.

00:09:54.550 --> 00:09:55.980
You're not fighting it today?

00:09:55.980 --> 00:09:58.850
Oh? You don't want me to leave?

00:09:58.850 --> 00:09:59.770
Go home!

00:10:00.910 --> 00:10:03.420
You can have the canned peaches.

00:10:09.810 --> 00:10:13.580
I didn't notice because of her, but it's snowing again...

00:10:13.580 --> 00:10:15.460
Yaaaay!

00:10:15.980 --> 00:10:17.320
It's snow! Snow!

00:10:22.420 --> 00:10:25.130
On the way home. On the way home.

00:10:29.050 --> 00:10:30.500
Thought so.

00:10:31.710 --> 00:10:34.480
I can't eat anymore...

00:10:36.380 --> 00:10:37.980
Delicious!

00:10:38.600 --> 00:10:41.060
Lunch break. Lunch break.

00:10:43.340 --> 00:10:45.360
I want a remote controlled toy.

00:10:45.980 --> 00:10:46.920
Huh?

00:10:59.690 --> 00:11:04.580
I saw a kid playing with one yesterday on the way home.

00:11:05.750 --> 00:11:08.780
I asked if I could play too, but they said no.

00:11:08.780 --> 00:11:11.010
Don't go annoying kids.

00:11:11.010 --> 00:11:12.430
I couldn't find anything else,

00:11:12.430 --> 00:11:15.920
so I brought a controller I had at home!

00:11:15.920 --> 00:11:18.780
What are you going to do with that?

00:11:18.780 --> 00:11:22.060
I thought I'd at least pretend to have one.

00:11:22.740 --> 00:11:24.710
And here's the antenna.

00:11:25.440 --> 00:11:27.060
I'm sure you get what's next.

00:11:27.060 --> 00:11:28.090
No, I don't.

00:11:28.090 --> 00:11:29.110
You don't?

00:11:29.530 --> 00:11:31.070
You do this...

00:11:31.070 --> 00:11:32.580
Like hell!

00:11:32.580 --> 00:11:34.090
It'll be fun!

00:11:34.090 --> 00:11:35.560
It'll totally be fun!

00:11:35.560 --> 00:11:37.430
For you! No way!

00:11:37.430 --> 00:11:38.710
Fine then.

00:11:38.710 --> 00:11:40.040
I'll play by myself.

00:11:40.040 --> 00:11:43.550
I'm not going to let you play even  after you see that it's totally fun.

00:12:00.660 --> 00:12:03.230
Raw Yasuna Beam!

00:12:08.900 --> 00:12:10.500
Look at this then!

00:12:10.500 --> 00:12:13.410
I'll show you how I can control this ball!

00:12:16.240 --> 00:12:17.910
Look! Amazing, right?

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:20.080
I'm miraculously moving it!

00:12:21.050 --> 00:12:23.750
Have I shocked you into speechlessness?

00:12:23.750 --> 00:12:25.180
Well, Sonya-chan?

00:12:30.760 --> 00:12:35.260
I am a daffodil.

00:12:38.190 --> 00:12:39.540
Fine, whatever.

00:12:39.540 --> 00:12:42.810
I'll just pretend to control this pigeon.

00:12:44.710 --> 00:12:46.150
That's pretty sad.

00:12:48.380 --> 00:12:50.950
What do you think of my technique?

00:12:50.950 --> 00:12:52.820
Take that! Bombs away!

00:12:56.030 --> 00:12:58.810
But I was just pretending...

00:12:58.810 --> 00:13:01.610
I know, but you were pissing me off.

00:13:03.460 --> 00:13:05.720
I've had enough. I'm going back.

00:13:06.320 --> 00:13:08.450
Dammit, my 100 yen coin!

00:13:09.430 --> 00:13:11.030
Look at my cornering!

00:13:11.800 --> 00:13:12.880
Give me that!

00:13:14.390 --> 00:13:17.930
You could have just said so if you wanted to play too!

00:13:17.930 --> 00:13:18.460
Okay!

00:13:23.190 --> 00:13:27.460
So it's true that you can make it stop when you break the controller.

00:13:33.310 --> 00:13:33.980
Go.

00:13:34.740 --> 00:13:36.120
Destroy! Destroy!

00:13:36.120 --> 00:13:37.660
Destroy! Destroy!

00:13:38.310 --> 00:13:39.660
Fine then.

00:13:40.170 --> 00:13:43.370
Toys like that cost too much, so I'll do origami instead.

00:13:45.450 --> 00:13:47.220
Look at what I folded!

00:13:47.220 --> 00:13:48.860
Want to try too?

00:13:49.310 --> 00:13:50.050
No.

00:13:50.050 --> 00:13:53.510
Come on, I haven't used the silver or gold yet!

00:13:53.510 --> 00:13:55.360
I said no!

00:13:57.160 --> 00:13:58.390
Don't tell me...

00:13:58.390 --> 00:14:00.060
You don't know how to fold origami?

00:14:01.550 --> 00:14:04.540
I can live without knowing how.

00:14:04.540 --> 00:14:07.100
Yes, but it's more fun if—

00:14:08.700 --> 00:14:10.940
It's no fun if you fold that!

00:14:12.040 --> 00:14:15.630
Here, I'm sure you can make a paper airplane.

00:14:15.630 --> 00:14:17.240
That much I can do.

00:14:23.880 --> 00:14:25.370
Like that'll fly.

00:14:27.940 --> 00:14:29.540
It will.

00:14:30.100 --> 00:14:31.880
This one's pretty good.

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:37.770
There's no point if it can't fly!

00:14:37.770 --> 00:14:38.870
Ta da!

00:14:39.460 --> 00:14:42.810
Behold this exquisite golden paper airplane!

00:14:42.810 --> 00:14:44.730
Gold!

00:14:46.060 --> 00:14:47.560
Gold!

00:14:48.080 --> 00:14:50.040
My gold...

00:14:50.840 --> 00:14:52.400
That certainly didn't live up to its name.

00:14:53.230 --> 00:14:56.100
Then let's have a contest to see whose can fly longer!

00:14:56.100 --> 00:14:57.740
Fine with me.

00:14:57.740 --> 00:15:02.240
My exquisite silver paper airplane will never lose!

00:15:03.490 --> 00:15:05.250
The color has nothing to do with it.

00:15:05.250 --> 00:15:06.020
Go!

00:15:06.020 --> 00:15:06.750
Silver!

00:15:08.250 --> 00:15:10.960
Yes! I win!

00:15:10.960 --> 00:15:12.250
Out of bounds!

00:15:12.250 --> 00:15:13.250
What?

00:15:13.250 --> 00:15:17.020
I win because I was aiming for the garbage bin.

00:15:17.020 --> 00:15:18.180
Liar!

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:21.100
After that. After that.

00:15:23.100 --> 00:15:26.020
Hey, it's your paper airplane!

00:15:26.480 --> 00:15:29.440
Wow, it's still flying?

00:15:30.690 --> 00:15:32.160
I lose...

00:15:32.960 --> 00:15:35.510
Clearly my technique is superior.

00:15:35.510 --> 00:15:38.460
It's flying! Flying!

00:15:43.670 --> 00:15:46.720
Another day. Another day.

00:15:51.570 --> 00:15:54.350
Come to the empty classroom after school.

00:15:54.760 --> 00:15:56.460
Another assassin?

00:15:56.460 --> 00:15:58.350
Hm? What's wrong?

00:15:58.350 --> 00:15:59.400
Nothing.

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:00.650
What is it?

00:16:00.650 --> 00:16:01.770
A love letter?

00:16:01.770 --> 00:16:02.490
A thumb tack?

00:16:02.490 --> 00:16:03.980
A razor letter?

00:16:03.980 --> 00:16:04.870
A threatening letter?

00:16:04.870 --> 00:16:05.650
A letter of challenge?

00:16:05.650 --> 00:16:07.060
A written challenge?!

00:16:11.820 --> 00:16:14.680
After school. After school.

00:16:20.000 --> 00:16:22.920
What kind of idiot is it this time?

00:16:26.130 --> 00:16:28.080
Merry Christmas!

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:31.680
Dammit! This was another one of your pranks?!

00:16:33.200 --> 00:16:36.260
Welcome to the Christmas Party classroom!

00:16:36.650 --> 00:16:39.160
A Christmas party?

00:16:40.420 --> 00:16:42.440
Yep! I even bought some cake!

00:16:43.220 --> 00:16:45.160
You did all this...

00:16:45.160 --> 00:16:47.360
You even brought that?

00:16:47.750 --> 00:16:50.340
We can't do hot pot in the classroom.

00:16:50.340 --> 00:16:53.750
Says the person who brings knives and all that to school.

00:16:54.410 --> 00:16:56.620
Besides, it's not hot pot.

00:16:56.620 --> 00:16:57.740
Don't lie!

00:16:57.740 --> 00:16:59.820
I'm not.

00:16:59.820 --> 00:17:00.510
Look!

00:17:03.320 --> 00:17:06.250
Standing rice?!

00:17:06.250 --> 00:17:09.210
It's not like we do this every day!

00:17:11.440 --> 00:17:13.170
Is Agiri coming too?

00:17:13.170 --> 00:17:15.020
She should be here soon.

00:17:15.950 --> 00:17:16.990
There she is.

00:17:18.190 --> 00:17:22.390
Merry Christmas and a Happy New Year!

00:17:22.890 --> 00:17:26.240
Please hand over candy or presents for a New Year gift.

00:17:26.240 --> 00:17:29.120
Cash or treat!

00:17:29.120 --> 00:17:31.770
What's with that outfit?

00:17:31.770 --> 00:17:36.520
We never did Halloween, so I figured I'd mix it in too.

00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:39.750
If you're going to dress like Santa, don't ask us for something.

00:17:39.750 --> 00:17:41.270
Shouldn't you give us something?

00:17:41.880 --> 00:17:49.300
There's still a week before Christmas, so I can't just give stuff away for free.

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:51.760
How pragmatic...

00:17:51.760 --> 00:17:54.680
That being the case...

00:17:55.100 --> 00:17:57.370
What do we do?

00:17:57.370 --> 00:17:58.820
Just go with it.

00:17:58.820 --> 00:18:00.560
This was all your plan after all.

00:18:02.140 --> 00:18:06.820
I don't have any cash, so please take this cake.

00:18:06.820 --> 00:18:09.940
Hmmm, I guess it'll have to do.

00:18:11.880 --> 00:18:13.040
Alright.

00:18:14.280 --> 00:18:16.870
Here's a present for the good little girl.

00:18:17.280 --> 00:18:20.550
Yay! Woohoo! A present!

00:18:21.020 --> 00:18:22.560
Hey, don't be stupid.

00:18:22.560 --> 00:18:24.660
That's the cake you just gave her.

00:18:25.930 --> 00:18:28.180
Well then, have a great year to come!

00:18:28.180 --> 00:18:30.340
I'll see you again next year!

00:18:32.270 --> 00:18:33.840
She left.

00:18:33.840 --> 00:18:36.100
Who was that?

00:18:37.660 --> 00:18:40.220
Since when have you been there?

00:18:40.750 --> 00:18:43.170
For a while now.

00:18:47.900 --> 00:18:49.660
So yummy!

00:18:49.650 --> 00:18:53.570
Oooh, there's one left.

00:18:54.020 --> 00:18:55.210
Who wants it?

00:18:55.210 --> 00:18:57.820
Ooh me, me! I do!

00:18:57.820 --> 00:19:00.810
We'll play bingo to see who gets it!

00:19:00.810 --> 00:19:01.950
I don't want it.

00:19:01.950 --> 00:19:03.460
I'm already full.

00:19:03.460 --> 00:19:05.360
I don't either.

00:19:05.750 --> 00:19:08.970
Even if it's a lie, pretend that you want it!

00:19:08.970 --> 00:19:10.380
It's not fun at all!

00:19:10.380 --> 00:19:13.380
I even prepared this...

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:16.160
Well, even if we're not battling for the cake,

00:19:16.160 --> 00:19:19.210
we can have the loser do something else. How's that?

00:19:19.210 --> 00:19:21.000
Good one!

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:23.350
She never learns.

00:19:25.020 --> 00:19:28.790
I'm gonna have the loser do something super embarrassing!

00:19:31.780 --> 00:19:32.920
Lost.

00:19:33.190 --> 00:19:34.470
Do it already.

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:44.860
Hi, I'm Oribe Yasuna, and here's the penalty I'm going to do for you.

00:19:48.960 --> 00:19:50.310
Drill tank!

00:19:50.310 --> 00:19:52.250
Hey, is this...

00:19:52.560 --> 00:19:54.300
Yep! Plum-flavored soda.

00:19:54.300 --> 00:19:57.470
Dammit, you aren't even watching!

00:20:02.740 --> 00:20:05.220
That was so much fun!

00:20:05.820 --> 00:20:11.850
Hey, Sonya-chan, you're going to dress up like Santa for work on Christmas, right?

00:20:11.850 --> 00:20:13.440
What? Why?

00:20:13.440 --> 00:20:17.180
So you can trick whoever's after you, of course!

00:20:17.670 --> 00:20:21.990
I'll give this bomb-rigged gift to the target.

00:20:21.990 --> 00:20:22.420
Here.

00:20:22.420 --> 00:20:24.240
I'm an adult, so I don't need it.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:25.050
Here.

00:20:25.050 --> 00:20:26.120
No thanks.

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:27.110
Here.

00:20:27.110 --> 00:20:28.390
Nope.

00:20:28.960 --> 00:20:30.330
No, thank you.

00:20:34.990 --> 00:20:37.800
Won't someone accept it?!

00:20:41.080 --> 00:20:42.300
Kinda like that!

00:20:42.300 --> 00:20:44.380
Don't go imagining that!

00:20:44.380 --> 00:20:45.510
Besides, that's not like me!

00:20:45.990 --> 00:20:47.740
Also, the ending was terrible!

00:20:50.120 --> 00:20:51.110
How about...

00:20:51.800 --> 00:20:54.000
I've given up on killing people.

00:20:54.000 --> 00:20:56.770
So here's a real present.

00:21:02.040 --> 00:21:03.820
Someone snuck in through the chimney!

00:21:02.430 --> 00:21:03.820
Daddy!

00:21:04.150 --> 00:21:05.950
So something like that?

00:21:05.950 --> 00:21:07.060
I'm done!

00:21:07.060 --> 00:21:08.470
Wait!

00:21:09.830 --> 00:21:13.070
Here. My Christmas present to you.

00:21:16.560 --> 00:21:17.840
Super cute!

00:21:18.330 --> 00:21:21.670
If you have that, you won't be lonely during the winter break.

00:21:21.670 --> 00:21:24.620
Isn't that nice, Sonya-chan?

00:21:28.540 --> 00:21:31.060
W-Wait... what are you doing?

00:21:32.820 --> 00:21:36.080
Wait, where's my present?

00:21:37.320 --> 00:21:39.400
What did you get me?

00:21:39.400 --> 00:21:42.050
Maybe an RC car!

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:43.840
You prepared something, right?

00:21:43.840 --> 00:21:46.930
I'll be happy with whatever you give me.

00:21:46.930 --> 00:21:48.490
Here, then.

00:21:48.490 --> 00:21:50.620
Woohoo!!

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:52.780
It looks just like me!

00:21:53.270 --> 00:21:54.710
Wait...

00:21:54.710 --> 00:21:58.450
Wait! Sonya-chan!

00:22:04.750 --> 00:22:08.660
Santa, Icicles, Snow Daruma.

00:23:40.970 --> 00:23:43.360
The head wind simply exits,

00:23:43.360 --> 00:23:45.630
brushing the rice ears in the early evening.

00:23:45.630 --> 00:23:47.760
The bamboo lights up, the peaches splits.

00:23:47.760 --> 00:23:50.170
And the cranes screech while bathing.

00:23:50.170 --> 00:23:52.440
The ogre faces west, while the kite to the east.

00:23:52.440 --> 00:23:54.850
Fill the stomach with food and fall half-asleep.

00:23:54.850 --> 00:23:56.890
The glittering lights of the Milky Way

00:23:56.890 --> 00:23:58.970
Hunting for amusement at the Gates of Hell.

00:23:59.730 --> 00:24:01.790
Next time, on Kill Me Baby,

00:24:01.790 --> 00:24:03.710
Kill number eleven:

00:24:03.710 --> 00:24:06.390
Bath, Kite, Mochi, First Dream of the Year.

00:24:06.390 --> 00:24:09.290
Now, what will you do, Oribe Yasuna?
